# Make a named person or team the required reviewer for the knowledge base.
# Add to .github/CODEOWNERS (or CODEOWNERS) and turn on "Require review from Code Owners"
# in branch protection. milepost cannot know your team names, so `milepost init` does not write this.
#
# An agent edit to a note sets it back to `status: draft`; only a person running
# `milepost review` sets `reviewed`. This line makes that person a required approver.

/kb/            @your-org/code-owners
/milepost.toml  @your-org/code-owners
